[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: ETH-W5500 Extension Hardware Requirements
UID: ETH-HW
VERSION: 0.1
OPTIONS:
  VIEW_STYLE: Table

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: requirements.sgra

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Hardware requirements of the W5500 Ethernet extension. Design compliance
refers to the repository state 2025-09-28 and the production review of
2026-11-25 (simulations S1-S4, rule based EMC analysis).
<<<

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Host interface and power

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-001
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Mechanical
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Mating connector
STATEMENT: >>>
The extension shall mate with J7 of the main board with a 2x5 2.54 mm SMD
socket with a stack height that clears the ESP32 module.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-020
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-100

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-002
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Not met
TITLE: Supply selection
STATEMENT: >>>
The supply source shall be selectable by solder jumpers, and the default
assembly shall have the 3.3 V jumper (JP4) closed.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
JP4/JP5 are open ex works. Proposal: SolderJumper_2_Bridged for JP4, U2 and
JP5 as option.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-010
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-012
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-201

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-003
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Performance
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Simulation
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Supply voltage of the W5500
STATEMENT: >>>
The W5500 supply shall stay within 2.97-3.63 V during ESP32-S3 load steps at a
slot source resistance of up to 2 Ohm.
<<<
SOURCE: ETH review 2026-11-25 (S1)
COMMENT: With JP4.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-011
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-012

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-004
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: EMC
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Analog supply filtering
STATEMENT: >>>
The analog supply of the W5500 shall be separated from the digital supply by a
ferrite bead and decoupled within 3 mm of each AVDD pin.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-012

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-005
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Interface
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Reset and interrupt
STATEMENT: >>>
RSTn and INTn of the W5500 shall be connected to J1 pins 6 and 8. RSTn shall
be high (inactive) when the host does not drive it.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
High level via W5500 internal pull-up and the SDA pull-up R4 of the main
board.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-100
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-202

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-006
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Constraint
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Not met
TITLE: Unused pins
STATEMENT: Reserved W5500 pins shall be connected as the datasheet requires.
SOURCE: ETH review 2026-11-25
COMMENT: Pin 23 (RSVD) is open; datasheet requires GND.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-010

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-007
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: PHY mode straps
STATEMENT: >>>
PMODE0-2 shall be configurable by solder jumpers and default to "all capable,
auto-negotiation enabled".
<<<
COMMENT: JP1-JP3 (open = internal pull-up = 111).
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-010

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Clock

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-010
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Performance
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Analysis
COMPLIANCE: Not met
TITLE: Clock accuracy
STATEMENT: >>>
The 25 MHz clock shall stay within +-50 ppm including tolerance, temperature
drift, ageing and load capacitance mismatch.
<<<
SOURCE: ETH review 2026-11-25 (S2)
COMMENT: >>>
18 pF load capacitors give about 13 pF effective load; HC-49 crystals with CL
18-20 pF run 120-150 ppm fast. Proposal: 3225 crystal C9006 (CL 12 pF) with 15
pF.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-010

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-011
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: EMC
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Review
COMPLIANCE: Not met
TITLE: Crystal placement
STATEMENT: >>>
Crystal and load capacitors shall be placed close to XI/XO over an
uninterrupted GND area without other signals below.
<<<
COMMENT: Crystal 7-10 mm from the pins, +3V3/5VBUD traces on B.Cu below it.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-022
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-010

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Network front end

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-020
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Performance
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Simulation
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: MDI termination
STATEMENT: >>>
TX and RX pairs shall be terminated so that the return loss at the RJ45 meets
IEEE 802.3 (100BASE-TX) up to 80 MHz.
<<<
SOURCE: ETH review 2026-11-25 (S3)
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-011

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-021
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Performance
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Simulation, Test
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: TX amplitude
STATEMENT: >>>
The transmit amplitude shall be within 950-1050 mV. The EXRES1 resistor shall
be 12.4 kOhm 1 %.
<<<
COMMENT: 12 kOhm (Basic part) would give +3.3 % and little margin.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-011

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-022
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: EMC
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Pair routing
STATEMENT: >>>
Each differential pair shall be length matched within 1 mm and routed with 45
degree corners.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-011

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-023
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Protection
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Simulation, Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Partially met
TITLE: Common mode termination
STATEMENT: >>>
The Bob Smith termination capacitors shall be rated for the common mode surge
they see (at least 100 V for 0603, or 2 kV), and the capacitor to
chassis/shield shall be rated 2 kV and placed close to the shield pin.
<<<
SOURCE: ETH review 2026-11-25 (S4)
COMMENT: >>>
C28/C31/C32/C34 4.7 nF are 50 V; C33 1 nF 2 kV is 44 mm away from the shield
pad.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-021
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-022
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-011

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-024
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Protection
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Partially met
TITLE: Transformer
STATEMENT: >>>
The magnetics shall provide 1500 V rms isolation, a 1:1 ratio with centre taps
and be available at LCSC.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Würth 749013011A is expensive; H1102NLT (C18584) is pad and pin compatible.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-021
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-030
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-011

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-025
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Manufacturing
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Not met
TITLE: RJ45 jack
STATEMENT: >>>
The RJ45 jack shall be SMD, have link and activity LEDs and be stocked at LCSC
for at least 150 boards.
<<<
COMMENT: Würth 634008137521: 47 pcs. Proposal HC-RJ45-5JAS-1-5-01.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-004
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-030
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-101

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Layout

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-030
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: EMC
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Review
COMPLIANCE: Not met
TITLE: Continuous reference for SPI
STATEMENT: >>>
SPI lines shall run over a continuous GND reference. Supply traces shall not
cut the GND plane below them.
<<<
SOURCE: ETH review 2026-11-25
COMMENT: SCLK 59 %, nCS 61 % of their length without reference.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-022
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-010

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-031
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Protection
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Review
COMPLIANCE: Not met
TITLE: Line side clearance
STATEMENT: >>>
Copper of the line side (after the transformer, PoE pairs, Bob Smith node,
shield) shall keep at least 2 mm to primary side copper, and the area between
transformer and jack shall be free of GND.
<<<
COMMENT: 0.2 mm everywhere; GND under J2 and TR1.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-021
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-011

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-032
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Manufacturing
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Design rules
STATEMENT: >>>
Traces at 45 degrees, GND pads with thermal reliefs, copper to edge at least
0.4 mm, edge stitching.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-030

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Production

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-040
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Manufacturing
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Not met
TITLE: LCSC part numbers
STATEMENT: Every assembled part shall have an LCSC part number in the schematic.
COMMENT: Candidates selected in the review; JLC field not yet in the schematic.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-030

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ETH-HW-041
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Manufacturing
PRIORITY: Should
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Not met
TITLE: Optional parts not assembled
STATEMENT: The PoE connector J3 and the LDO U2 shall not be assembled by default.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-031
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-013
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYA-201

[[/SECTION]]
